```plantuml
@startuml
title STUDY2WORK - Sequence Diagram - Đăng ký tài khoản (DD Ready)

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam roundcorner 12

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #3C3C3C
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  ParticipantBorderColor #666666
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ActorBorderColor #666666
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BoxBorderColor #BBBBBB
  BoxBackgroundColor #FCFCFC
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9D9
  NoteBorderColor #B8A24A
}

actor "Khách truy cập" as Guest

boundary "Frontend UI\n(Web/Mobile)" as UI

control "AuthController\n/api/v1/auth" as AC

control "Validation Layer" as VL

entity "AuthService" as AS

database "Redis Cache" as Redis

entity "UserRepository" as UR
entity "RoleRepository" as RR
entity "ProfileRepository" as PR
entity "VerificationTokenRepository" as TR

database "MySQL Database" as DB

collections "Mail Service" as Mail

== Người dùng gửi yêu cầu đăng ký ==

Guest -> UI : Nhập thông tin đăng ký\n(email, phone, password, fullName)

UI -> AC : POST /api/v1/auth/register\nRequest Body(RegisterRequestDTO)

note right of AC
API:
POST /api/v1/auth/register

Input:
- email
- phone
- password
- fullName

Output:
- success
- message
- verificationRequired
- userId

HTTP:
- 201 CREATED
- 400 BAD REQUEST
- 409 CONFLICT
end note

AC -> VL : validate(RegisterRequestDTO)

note right of VL
Validate:
- Required field
- Email format
- Phone format
- Password policy
- Duplicate field check
end note

VL --> AC : validationResult

alt Validation fail

    AC --> UI : 400 BAD REQUEST\nValidation Error

else Validation success

    AC -> AS : register(dto)

    activate AS

    == Kiểm tra email hoặc phone đã tồn tại ==

    AS -> UR : existsByEmailOrPhone(email, phone)

    note right of UR
    Repository Method:
    existsByEmailOrPhone()

    Input:
    - email
    - phone

    Output:
    - boolean exists
    end note

    UR -> DB : SELECT id,email,phone\nFROM users\nWHERE email=? OR phone=?\nLIMIT 1

    note right of DB
    Database:
    READ users

    Purpose:
    Kiểm tra tài khoản tồn tại

    Returned:
    - id
    - email
    - phone
    end note

    DB --> UR : existingUser/null

    UR --> AS : true/false

    alt Email hoặc phone đã tồn tại

        AS --> AC : BusinessException(USER_ALREADY_EXISTS)

        note right of AC
        Response:
        HTTP 409 CONFLICT

        Error Code:
        USER_ALREADY_EXISTS
        end note

        AC --> UI : Hiển thị lỗi tài khoản tồn tại

    else Chưa tồn tại

        == Hash mật khẩu ==

        AS -> AS : bcrypt.hash(password)

        note right of AS
        Security:
        Password Hashing
        Algorithm: BCrypt
        end note

        == Tạo user ==

        AS -> UR : createUser(userEntity)

        note right of UR
        Repository Method:
        createUser()

        Input:
        - email
        - phone
        - passwordHash
        - status
        - createdAt

        Output:
        - userId
        end note

        UR -> DB : INSERT INTO users(...)

        note right of DB
        Database:
        WRITE users

        Fields:
        - email
        - phone
        - password_hash
        - account_status
        - created_at

        Returned:
        - user_id
        end note

        DB --> UR : generated user_id

        UR --> AS : user_id

        == Gán role mặc định ==

        AS -> RR : assignDefaultRole(user_id,"STUDENT")

        note right of RR
        Repository Method:
        assignDefaultRole()

        Input:
        - user_id
        - role_code

        Output:
        - success
        end note

        RR -> DB : INSERT INTO user_roles(...)

        note right of DB
        Database:
        WRITE user_roles

        Fields:
        - user_id
        - role_id
        - assigned_at
        end note

        DB --> RR : insert success

        RR --> AS : success

        == Tạo hồ sơ mặc định ==

        AS -> PR : createDefaultProfile(user_id)

        note right of PR
        Repository Method:
        createDefaultProfile()

        Input:
        - user_id

        Output:
        - profile_id
        end note

        PR -> DB : INSERT INTO user_profiles(...)

        note right of DB
        Database:
        WRITE user_profiles

        Fields:
        - user_id
        - full_name
        - avatar_url
        - bio
        - learning_status
        end note

        DB --> PR : profile_id

        PR --> AS : profile_id

        == Sinh OTP / Verification Token ==

        AS -> AS : generateVerificationToken()

        note right of AS
        Token:
        - random token
        - expire time
        - verification type
        end note

        AS -> TR : saveVerificationToken(tokenEntity)

        note right of TR
        Repository Method:
        saveVerificationToken()

        Input:
        - user_id
        - token
        - expired_at
        - verification_type

        Output:
        - token_id
        end note

        TR -> DB : INSERT INTO user_verification_tokens(...)

        note right of DB
        Database:
        WRITE user_verification_tokens

        Fields:
        - user_id
        - token
        - token_type
        - expired_at
        - is_used
        end note

        DB --> TR : token_id

        TR --> AS : token_id

        == Cache OTP ==

        AS -> Redis : SET verify_token:{userId}

        note right of Redis
        Cache:
        verification token

        TTL:
        5 minutes
        end note

        Redis --> AS : success

        == Gửi email xác thực ==

        AS -> Mail : sendVerificationEmail(email, token)

        note right of Mail
        Email Template:
        VERIFY_ACCOUNT

        Payload:
        - email
        - otp/token
        - expiredTime
        end note

        Mail --> AS : sent success

        == Commit transaction ==

        note right of AS
        Transaction:
        COMMIT

        Rollback when:
        - insert fail
        - token fail
        - role fail
        - profile fail
        end note

        AS --> AC : RegisterSuccessResponse

        note right of AC
        Response Body:
        {
          success: true,
          verificationRequired: true,
          userId,
          message
        }
        end note

        AC --> UI : 201 CREATED\nĐăng ký thành công

        UI --> Guest : Điều hướng màn hình xác thực OTP/email

    end

    deactivate AS

end

@enduml
```
